\"Circle of Claude\" agent-team bundle\n(source: C:\\Users\\sarve\\Desktop\\claude-teams) by `scripts/new-project.mjs` on 2026-09-29.\nIt has its own independent `.claude/`, its own `trail.md`, and nothing built yet.\n\n## Before anything else\n\n1. Open **this folder** as its own Claude Code session (a fresh session,\n   not `/resume` from anywhere else) - hooks, custom agents and slash\n   commands only load from the folder Claude Code was actually launched\n   in, not from a parent or sibling directory.\n2. Run the health checks in `SETUP.md` §2 (`python scripts/verify-session.py`\n   covers most of them).\n3. Run `/start` (talk through what you want to build) or `/build` (if you\n   already have a `docs/brief.md`) to begin.\n\nBringing existing code? Copy it into this folder before `/split`: the\nsplitter reads source only when `node scripts/detect-codebase.mjs` finds some.\n\n## Keeping this separate from other projects on the same machine\n\nIf you run more than one project built from this bundle at the same time,\ngive each its own local ports once it has servers (database, backend, dev\nserver), set in that project's own config. Nothing here is shared between\nprojects - each has its own `.claude/`, its own git history and its own state.\n","numLines":27,"startLine":1,"totalLines":27}}}
